OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAreas of
OL,6,Fcloud and some clearer periods. Most
OL,7,Fparts dry but thicker cloud developing
OL,8,Facross the Pennines later with patchy
OL,9,Flight rain and drizzle, along with
OL,10,Fsome hill fog. Mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FAreas of cloud giving some
OL,13,Fpatchy rain or showers but also some
OL,14,Fdrier, brighter periods.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
