OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FChangeable and windy, with showers or
OL,7,Flonger spells of rain, interspersed
OL,8,Fwith drier, brighter periods.
OL,9,FTemperatures should start a little
OL,10,Fabove normal at first, but should
OL,11,Ftrend nearer normal later.
